      <!-- SUPPORT HEROES -->
      <div id="section-support" class="tips-section tips-anchor">
        <h2>Support Heroes</h2>
        <p>Understanding the difference between Energy Support and Tempo Support helps you build better team synergies and choose the right support for your carry.</p>

        <h3>Energy Support vs Tempo Support</h3>
        <div class="tips-support-comparison">
          <div class="tips-support-card">
            <div class="tips-support-label">Energy Support</div>
            <p class="tips-support-desc">Provides energy generation and battery effects to sustain your carry's ultimate casts.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Caishen</strong> - instant 100 energy and sustained regen to nearby allies. Best-in-slot battery.</li>
              <li><strong>Diana</strong> - grants 15 Energy per second</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid u-mt-3">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/caishen">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/caishen.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Caishen</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/diana">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/diana.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Diana</span>
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="tips-support-card">
            <div class="tips-support-label">Tempo Support</div>
            <p class="tips-support-desc">Provides attack speed and movement speed buffs to accelerate your team's rotation and positioning.</p>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Dionysus (Starglint)</strong> - Frenzy gives 50% ATK speed and 50% move speed to all allies. Strongest tempo tool in the game.</li>
              <li><strong>Athena</strong> - 40-60% ATK speed to all allies</li>
              <li><strong>Diana</strong> - Waxing Blessing fires at combat start with 40% ATK speed</li>
            </ul>
            <div class="hero-chip-grid u-mt-3">
              <a class="hero-pic chip-highlight" href="/heroes/dionysus">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/dionysus.webp')"></div>
                <span class="hero-chip-name">Dionysus</span>
              </a>
              <a class="hero-pic" href="/heroes/athena">
                <div class="hero-chip-portrait" style="background-image:url('https://pub-a33abfbc3135413881a1d8eb86543559.r2.dev/heroes/athena.webp')"></div>
